    {
      "point": "Both mention the number four in connection with the gods.",
      "quote_britannica": "the fests go are laid to be, in number, four, viz. Axieros, Axiocerla, Axiocerfius, and Calinila",
      "quote_wikipedia": "usually between two and four, some of either sex"
